  "description": "A release of 35 explicit Max-k-Cut vertex partitions on 10 G-set graphs, with a short results paper and two dependency-free verification programs. Relative to the published comparison values identified as of October 15, 2026, the data include seven improvements (G81 k=3: 16510; G22 k=4: 18787; G55 k=3: 12437; G1-G4 k=5: 17706, 17710, 17705, 17710), 17 matches including three provably optimal all-edges-cut partitions, and ten reference values for k=6 and k=8 on G1-G5 without an identified directly comparable published baseline. One additional G81 k=4 partition has value 16666, below the published Gurobi value 16670, and is not claimed as an improvement. The release publishes solutions and verification certificates; solution-generation algorithms are outside its scope.",
  "creators": [
    {
      "name": "Chen, Yaocheng",
      "affiliation": "Instituto de Astronomia, Geofísica e Ciências Atmosféricas (IAG-USP), Universidade de São Paulo"
    }
  ],
